Vendored front-end libraries, embedded in the binary. To update one, replace the file
and change the line here. The one exception to "just replace the file" is CodeMirror 6,
which is modular: console/cm6/ holds its pinned packages and entry point, and
`cd console/cm6 && bun install && bun run build` writes static/cm6.min.js.

